{"seq":1,"slug":"vat-fundamentals","title":"增值税基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/tax-practice/vat-fundamentals","wordCount":1580,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"增值税基础\">增值税基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>增值税是我国第一大税种，约占全部税收收入的40%。作为一种&quot;价外税&quot;，增值税最终由消费者承担，企业在生产流通各环节仅对&quot;增值部分&quot;纳税。理解增值税的运行机制，是会计从业者必备的核心税务知识。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增值税的基本原理\">增值税的基本原理</h3><p>增值税的核心设计思想是<strong>链条式抵扣</strong>：每个环节只对本环节新增的价值部分缴税。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;原材料厂商&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;售价100&lt;br&gt;税13&quot;| B[&quot;制造商&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;售价200&lt;br&gt;税26&quot;| C[&quot;批发商&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;售价300&lt;br&gt;税39&quot;| D[&quot;零售商&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;售价400&lt;br&gt;税52&quot;| E[&quot;消费者&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"原材料厂商\"] --&gt;|\"售价100&lt;br&gt;税13\"| B[\"制造商\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"售价200&lt;br&gt;税26\"| C[\"批发商\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"售价300&lt;br&gt;税39\"| D[\"零售商\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"售价400&lt;br&gt;税52\"| E[\"消费者\"]</pre><p>各环节实际缴税：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>制造商：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>26</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26 - 13 = 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>（对增值100元的部分纳税）</li>\n<li>批发商：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>39</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">39 - 26 = 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>（对增值100元的部分纳税）</li>\n<li>零售商：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>52</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">52 - 39 = 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">52</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span>（对增值100元的部分纳税）</li>\n<li>全链条税负：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>52</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">13 + 13 + 13 + 13 = 52</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">52</span></span></span></span></span> = 消费者支付的税额</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>核心公式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>应纳增值税</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>销项税额</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>进项税额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{应纳增值税} = \\text{销项税额} - \\text{进项税额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应纳增值税</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">销项税额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进项税额</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>销项税额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>不含税销售额</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>税率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{销项税额} = \\text{不含税销售额} \\times \\text{税率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">销项税额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不含税销售额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"纳税人分类\">纳税人分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>认定标准（2026年）</th>\n<th>计税方式</th>\n<th>税率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一般纳税人</td>\n<td>年销售额 &gt; 500万元</td>\n<td>一般计税（销项-进项）</td>\n<td>13%/9%/6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小规模纳税人</td>\n<td>年销售额 ≤ 500万元</td>\n<td>简易计税</td>\n<td>征收率3%（减按1%优惠延续中）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>小规模纳税人计税简单：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>应纳税额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>不含税销售额</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>征收率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{应纳税额} = \\text{不含税销售额} \\times \\text{征收率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应纳税额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不含税销售额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">征收率</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>但小规模纳税人不能抵扣进项，且开具的普通发票对购买方不能抵扣。因此上下游都是一般纳税人时，交易更顺畅。</p>\n<h3 id=\"税率体系\">税率体系</h3><p>2026年现行增值税三档税率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>税率</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>13%</td>\n<td>销售货物（大部分实物商品）、加工修理修配劳务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9%</td>\n<td>交通运输、建筑服务、不动产销售和租赁、基本生活物资（粮油等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6%</td>\n<td>现代服务（金融、信息技术、咨询等）、生活服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>零税率</strong>：出口货物和跨境应税行为（鼓励出口，实行&quot;免抵退&quot;政策）。</p>\n<p><strong>免税</strong>：与零税率的区别——免税不退还已缴进项税，零税率可以退还。</p>\n<h3 id=\"进项税额抵扣\">进项税额抵扣</h3><p>一般纳税人可以抵扣的进项税额条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>取得合法有效的扣税凭证（增值税专用发票、海关缴款书等）</li>\n<li>用于应税项目（非用于免税、集体福利、个人消费）</li>\n<li>在规定期限内勾选认证（360天内）</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>不得抵扣的情形</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用于简易计税项目的进项</li>\n<li>用于免征增值税项目的进项</li>\n<li>用于集体福利或个人消费的购进（如员工福利用品）</li>\n<li>非正常损失对应的进项（如被盗存货）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>会计处理</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"购入商品（一般纳税人）：&#10;  借：库存商品    100,000&#10;      应交税费—应交增值税（进项税额）  13,000&#10;    贷：银行存款    113,000&#10;&#10;销售商品：&#10;  借：银行存款    226,000&#10;    贷：主营业务收入    200,000&#10;        应交税费—应交增值税（销项税额）  26,000&#10;&#10;月末计算应交税额：&#10;  应纳税额 = 销项 26,000 - 进项 13,000 = 13,000&#10;  借：应交税费—应交增值税（转出未交增值税）  13,000&#10;    贷：应交税费—未交增值税    13,000&#10;&#10;次月缴纳：&#10;  借：应交税费—未交增值税    13,000&#10;    贷：银行存款    13,000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>购入商品（一般纳税人）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：库存商品    100,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      应交税费—应交增值税（进项税额）  13,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：银行存款    113,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>销售商品：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：银行存款    226,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：主营业务收入    200,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        应交税费—应交增值税（销项税额）  26,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>月末计算应交税额：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  应纳税额 = 销项 26,000 - 进项 13,000 = 13,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：应交税费—应交增值税（转出未交增值税）  13,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：应交税费—未交增值税    13,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>次月缴纳：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：应交税费—未交增值税    13,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：银行存款    13,000</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"发票管理\">发票管理</h3><p>增值税发票是抵扣的核心凭证，2026年我国已全面推行全电发票（全面数字化电子发票）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发票类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>购方是否可抵扣</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增值税专用发票（电子）</td>\n<td>标注税额，用于抵扣</td>\n<td>✓ 一般纳税人可抵扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增值税普通发票（电子）</td>\n<td>标注税额但不可抵扣</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全电发票</td>\n<td>无需申领，系统自动赋码</td>\n<td>看票面标识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>发票管理要点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开具必须与真实交易一致（虚开发票是犯罪行为）</li>\n<li>作废/红冲必须在规定时间内且需要正当理由</li>\n<li>丢失发票需要登报声明并用记账联复印件代替</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"含税价与不含税价换算\">含税价与不含税价换算</h3><p>日常交易中报价通常含税，但入账和计税需使用不含税价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>不含税价</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>含税价</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>税率</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{不含税价} = \\frac{\\text{含税价}}{1 + \\text{税率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不含税价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">含税价</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>税额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>不含税价</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>税率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>含税价</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>税率</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>税率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{税额} = \\text{不含税价} \\times \\text{税率} = \\frac{\\text{含税价}}{1 + \\text{税率}} \\times \\text{税率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不含税价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">含税价</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>示例</strong>：一批货物含税售价 113,000 元（税率13%）</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>不含税价</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>113,000</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>100,000</mn><mtext> 元</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{不含税价} = \\frac{113{,}000}{1+13\\%} = 100{,}000 \\text{ 元}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不含税价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13%</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">113</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">元</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>税额</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>100,000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>13</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13,000</mn><mtext> 元</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{税额} = 100{,}000 \\times 13\\% = 13{,}000 \\text{ 元}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">税额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">元</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年增值税改革持续推进。立法方面，《增值税法》已正式实施，将此前散落在暂行条例和众多文件中的规定统一为法律层级，纳税人权利义务更加清晰。技术层面，税务部门基于&quot;金税四期&quot;系统实现了全票据、全链条的智能监管——企业开票、抵扣、申报的每一步都在系统监控中，人为操纵税负空间大幅压缩。</p>\n<p>对于会计从业者，这意味着合规成本在下降（系统自动校验），但合规要求在提高（容错空间更小）。全电发票取消了领用和验旧流程，开票更便捷，但对发票内容准确性的要求更严——一旦系统发现异常，会自动触发风险预警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某一般纳税人企业本月销售商品不含税价 500,000 元（13%税率），购进原材料取得专票注明税额 42,000 元，购进办公用品取得普票价税合计 5,650 元。计算本月应缴增值税。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某商店以含税价 339 元卖出一件商品（税率13%）。计算不含税售价和增值税额。如果进货含税价为 226 元，计算该商店对这件商品实际缴纳的增值税。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>判断以下进项能否抵扣，说明理由：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为生产车间购入设备取得的专票</li>\n<li>为员工食堂购入食材取得的专票</li>\n<li>因仓库失火烧毁的原材料对应的已抵扣进项</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考题：为什么说增值税&quot;层层抵扣&quot;的设计能有效避免重复征税？如果没有抵扣机制（如营业税时代），同样一件商品经过多个流通环节会出现什么问题？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>增值税通过&quot;销项减进项&quot;的链条式抵扣机制，确保了只对各环节的增值部分征税，避免了重复征税的弊端。一般纳税人适用三档税率（13%/9%/6%），小规模纳税人适用简易征收率。发票是增值税管理的核心工具——取得合规专票是抵扣进项的前提条件。在全电发票和金税四期的数字化监管环境下，合规操作不仅是法律要求，更是企业正常经营的基本保障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"增值税基础","id":"增值税基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"增值税的基本原理","id":"增值税的基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"纳税人分类","id":"纳税人分类"},{"level":3,"text":"税率体系","id":"税率体系"},{"level":3,"text":"进项税额抵扣","id":"进项税额抵扣"},{"level":3,"text":"发票管理","id":"发票管理"},{"level":3,"text":"含税价与不含税价换算","id":"含税价与不含税价换算"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"财务报表编制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/financial-accounting/financial-statements"},"next":{"title":"企业所得税与个人所得税","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/tax-practice/corporate-personal-tax"}}